@host = http://localhost:8080

### Endpoints
GET {{host}}/api

### t1 on the primary and on the replica, partitions with row counts
GET {{host}}/api/stats

### Latest operations (watch state go 0 -> 1)
GET {{host}}/api/operations?limit=10

### Add an operation (state = 0); every field is optional
POST {{host}}/api/operations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 150.25,
  "clientId": 42,
  "operationType": "online"
}

### Duplicate operation guid -> 409 Conflict (send twice)
POST {{host}}/api/operations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operationGuid": "01a1cf00-0000-7000-8000-000000000001",
  "amount": 1
}

### Operation by guid
GET {{host}}/api/operations/01a1cf00-0000-7000-8000-000000000001

### Run the 0 -> 1 confirmation right now (parity of the current second)
POST {{host}}/api/operations/confirm

### Materialized view t1_client_totals
GET {{host}}/api/client-totals?clientId=42

### Logical replication status and primary/replica comparison
GET {{host}}/api/replication
